      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Given that $f(x)={7}^{x}\\sin (x),$ find ${f}^{'}(x).$\n\n$f^{\\prime}(x)=$\n{{field-1}} $+\\,7^{x} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)={7}^{x}$ and $v(x)=\\sin (x).$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{'}(x) & ={({7}^{x})}^{'}\\sin (x)+{7}^{x}{(\\sin (x))}^{'} \\\\  & =({7}^{x}\\ln (7))\\sin (x)+{7}^{x}(\\cos (x)) \\\\  & ={7}^{x}\\ln (7)\\sin (x)+{7}^{x}\\cos (x)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
